From 4e5dbc2d05fdc060053b8a3c9b1345cbbcb62ca8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xbox360 Blades <xbox360-blades@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:06:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 51/54] XMP: the dashboard's music services (from xam 2858)

XMPDashInIt (819A90E0) and XMPSetMediaSourceWorkspace (819A62B0) accept
the dashboard; DashInIt broadcasts XN 0x8A000009 (1, then 0 once the
empty hard drive index is enumerated), so its Music area stops waiting.
Media queries 0x70014 / 0x7001C (819A5628 / 819A5C28: source record
checked, empty index), playlist song count 0x70031, source by type
0x70046, clear title playlist 0x70028, now playing queue mode 0x7004A,
playlist song enumeration 0x70041 and the playback data block 0x70033.
The media source table is shared by XMPGetMediaSources and 0x70046.

